msgstr "确定要删除所选的{{ objects_name }}吗？以下记录及其关联数据会一并删除："

msgid "Deleting the {{ object_name }} '{{ escaped_object }}' would require deleting the following protected related objects:"
msgstr "删除{{ object_name }}「{{ escaped_object }}」需要先删除以下受保护的关联记录："

msgid "Deleting the {{ object_name }} '{{ escaped_object }}' would result in deleting related objects, but your account doesn't have permission to delete the following types of objects:"
msgstr "删除{{ object_name }}「{{ escaped_object }}」会连带删除关联记录，但当前账号没有删除以下类型记录的权限："

msgid "Deleting the selected {{ objects_name }} would require deleting the following protected related objects:"
msgstr "删除所选{{ objects_name }}需要先删除以下受保护的关联记录："

msgid "Deleting the selected {{ objects_name }} would result in deleting related objects, but your account doesn't have permission to delete the following types of objects:"
